# The allowlist of tools/no-ledger-refs.sh: GLOB REGEX REASON...
* -O[0-3sgz]\b C compiler optimization levels (-O2, -O3)
* U\+[0-9A-Fa-f]{4,6} Unicode code points (U+D800)
runtime/third_party/pcre2/* \b[DFOPQR][0-9]+\b upstream PCRE2 and sljit sources: machine register and opcode-field names (R0, F3, F36) and pattern syntax ((?R0))
runtime/third_party/base64/* \b[DFOPQR][0-9]+\b upstream base64 sources: the assembly macros' register names (R0, R1)
runtime/third_party/yyjson/* \b[DFOPQR][0-9]+\b upstream yyjson source: UTF-8 lead-byte values written as hex (F0, F8)
